  "solution": {
    "text": "The output at $\\mathrm{C}$ corresponds to A NAND\n$$\n\\mathrm{B} \\text { or } \\overline{\\mathrm{A} \\cdot \\mathrm{B}}=\\mathrm{C}\n$$"
